 "description": "<p>Hermosa 2.0 runs ten tongue-licking modes and ten vibration modes through two motors — one at the head, one at the tail — with a single button keeping the operation simple despite the dual engine. The flower design with its cute tail is the look; the dual-motor grid is the substance.</p>\n<p><img style=\"float: none\" alt=\"Clit Licking Tongue Vibrator with G Spot Stimulator\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0557/0317/5349/files/76e1d293-a35c-46cc-aa57-36f840be1a81.__CR0_0_970_600_PT0_SX970_V1.jpg?v=1655977935\" data-mce-style=\"float: none;\"></p>\n<p>The spec block is printed completely: medical-grade silicone, 6.22 inches long and 1.73 wide, a 1.18-inch tongue, under 40 dB of noise, half an hour to ninety minutes of use per ninety-minute charge, USB pin-style cord, waterproof. The FAQ answers the real questions — the two ends alternate rather than run together, and the light tells you when charging completes.</p>\n<p>Foreplay-first is the positioning, and the mode banks support it: tongue settings for the slow arc, vibration for the spike, the flip of the toy deciding which end works. The one-year warranty the listing carries rounds out a build that reads finished.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Modes: 10 tongue licking + 10 vibration (2 motors)</li>\n<li>Material: medical-grade silicone</li>\n<li>Size: 6.22 x 1.73 in; tongue 1.18 in</li>\n<li>Noise: under 40 dB</li>\n<li>Battery: ~1.5 h charge / 0.5–1.5 h use, USB pin</li>\n<li>Waterproof: yes; 1-year warranty</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The spec-complete flower — dual motors, printed numbers, warranty attached.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Hermosa-2 flower vibrator with dual motors running 10 licking and 10 vibration modes, under 40 dB, waterproof with 1-year warranty.</p>\n",
